		{"id":"0d5fd55e19336320","type":"text","text":"# Ek implement etmek gereken seyler \n---\n\n* Conservativy Scoreu, dusuk var daha iyi\n* Farkli featureler (bu lagli/ paperde gecen seyleri falan denemek)\n* Bu denemeleri MLFLOWa kaydetmece\n* Minute data?","x":1080,"y":-989,"width":430,"height":298},
		{"id":"0d1ee4b94dfe2617","type":"text","text":"# Data Management\n---\n","x":1080,"y":-511,"width":510,"height":213},
